---
import Container from '../ui/Container.astro';
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 border-t border-line/60 bg-paper overflow-hidden">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-14 items-start">
      <!-- Left Column: Title with star + collaboration image -->
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-ink text-2xl font-black">✦</span>
          <span class="mono-label text-ink-dim font-bold">About WSS DevLabs</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="h-section mt-4 font-black tracking-tight text-ink">
          Turning Ideas Into <span class="badge-highlight">Masterpieces</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-8 aspect-[16/10] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white shadow-card">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&h=500&q=80"
            alt="WSS DevLabs Engineering Team"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Narrative + secondary engineer photo -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between h-full">
        <div>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-dim font-normal">
            Many businesses struggle to communicate their value clearly and scale efficiently. Fragile software, monthly SaaS subscription taxes, and opaque agencies cost trust, attention, and revenue.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink font-semibold">
            We bridge the gap between vision and impact by crafting high-performance systems that are strategic, intentional, and engineered for sustainable business growth.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 aspect-[16/10] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white shadow-card">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531482615713-2afd69097998?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&h=500&q=80"
            alt="Senior Architect Coding System"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>

